WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.292
Unit seven. Puberty Begins!

2
00:00:04.267 --> 00:00:08.019
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.069 --> 00:00:11.277
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.327 --> 00:00:14.968
Today we learn about Puberty Begins. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.055 --> 00:00:19.555
Puberty. Say it with me. Puberty!

6
00:00:23.055 --> 00:00:26.955
Hormones. Say it with me. Hormones!

7
00:00:30.456 --> 00:00:33.572
Growth. Say it with me. Growth!

8
00:00:37.085 --> 00:00:41.185
Body changes. Say it with me. Body changes!

9
00:00:44.674 --> 00:00:48.441
Emotions. Say it with me. Emotions!

10
00:00:51.937 --> 00:00:55.320
Normal. Say it with me. Normal!

11
00:00:58.804 --> 00:01:02.370
Hygiene. Say it with me. Hygiene!

12
00:01:05.901 --> 00:01:09.567
Questions. Say it with me. Questions!

13
00:01:13.057 --> 00:01:24.182
Puberty is the time when hormones cause body changes, growth, and new emotions. It starts at different ages for different people, and that is normal. Good hygiene and asking questions help.

14
00:01:24.232 --> 00:01:25.448
I can do that too!

15
00:01:26.755 --> 00:01:31.829
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:31.879 --> 00:01:33.029
Growth!

17
00:01:33.889 --> 00:01:39.250
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:40.450
Hygiene!

19
00:01:41.404 --> 00:01:48.852
Did you know? Puberty can start anywhere from about age 8 to 14 — everyone has their own timing!

20
00:01:48.902 --> 00:01:51.050
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:51.737 --> 00:01:59.745
Think and answer. Who could you ask if you have questions about puberty?

22
00:01:59.795 --> 00:02:00.945
Great answer!

23
00:02:02.165 --> 00:02:06.870
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
